                "title": "Butte Knob with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Butte Knob with Rectangular Rose has modern appeal and classic styling for a transitional piece that is a favorite among designers for its versatility. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Half Round Butte Knob with Rectangle Rose will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This rustic knob is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes.",
                "keywords": "Butte Knobset with #3 Rosettes, Butte Knob with Rectangular Roses, Emtek 7054BU, Emtek 7054BU, Emtek 7054BU, Sandcast Bronze Butte Knobset with Rectangular Rosettes, Butte Half-Round Knob with #3 Rectangle Roses, Half Round Butte Knob with Rectangle Roses, half-round knobs,"
